<title>SWEDEN: Sandvik Q1 profit falls 29 pct.</title>
<headline>Sandvik Q1 profit falls 29 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1996,</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		  941   vs     1,325</p>
<p> Turnover				  7,327   vs     7,422</p>
<p> Shr (crowns)			    10.15   vs     13.25</p>
<p> Operating result			  916   vs     1,198</p>
<p> Investments				 427   vs	 426</p>
<p> Costs for goods sold		  4,885   vs     4,731</p>
<p> Other costs			     1,587   vs     1,538</p>
<p> Interests in associates		  47   vs	  44</p>
<p> Net financial items	  CREDIT    25   vs	 127 CREDIT</p>
<p> Minorities				   37   vs	  43</p>
<p> Net profit				  624   vs	 902</p>
<p>NOTE -- Analysts polled by Reuters expected Sandvik, an engineering and specialty metals group, to post a profit of 1.05 billion crowns after financial items in the first quarter.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
